@page "/"

<PageTitle>Ticketing System</PageTitle>

<div class="container">
    <h1>Welcome to the Ticketing System</h1>
    <p class="lead">MVP, low-cost platform for ticket booking built with .NET 8 Blazor Server. </p>

    <p>The project is in development. More functionality will be added incrementally.</p>

    <div class="tech-overview">
        <h3>Infrastructure & Deployment</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>Hosting:</strong> Azure App Service (Linux, .NET 8, B1 tier, Sweden Central) | <strong>IaC:</strong> Bicep modules (env-specific deployments) | <strong>CI/CD:</strong> GitHub Actions → Docker → GHCR → App Service<br>
            <strong>Domain:</strong> ticket.mymh.dev (Let's Encrypt SSL, DNS-01) | <strong>Monitoring:</strong> Application Insights (telemetry, logging, performance) | <strong>Secrets:</strong> Key Vault (RBAC, managed identity)
        </p>

        <h3>Application Stack</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>Frontend:</strong> Blazor Server (.NET 8, SSR, SignalR) | <strong>API:</strong> ASP.NET Core Web API (Controller-based) | <strong>Database:</strong> Cosmos DB Serverless (NoSQL, pay-per-request)<br>
            <strong>Container:</strong> Docker multi-stage (SDK build, runtime production) | <strong>Registry:</strong> GHCR (public, no auth) | <strong>Auth:</strong> Cookie-based (ASP.NET Identity/Entra ID ready)
        </p>

        <h3>Architecture & Patterns</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>Design Patterns:</strong> Extension Methods (startup config), HttpClient Factory, Repository/Service (IBookingService), Dependency Injection (scoped/singleton)<br>
            <strong>Data:</strong> Cosmos DB (ticketing/bookings, partition: /customerId) | <strong>Serialization:</strong> camelCase naming policy (CosmosPropertyNamingPolicy) | <strong>Health:</strong> /api/health endpoint (non-sensitive status)
        </p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-muted">Version status: / Currently on week 4 of the Exam Project</p>
</div>
